menu "TWR Demo Configuration"

    config TWR_INITIATOR
        bool "TWR Initiator Mode"
        default n
        help
            Enable this for the initiator device that sends ranging requests.
            Disable for the responder device that answers ranging requests.

            Initiator: MAC16 = 0x0002, sends to 0x0001
            Responder: MAC16 = 0x0001, listens for requests

endmenu
